# Data — chính sách theo FIN05-Data-Brief.md §3.3: commit dữ liệu nhỏ + manifest
# (ground truth thật là generator + seed + checksum), không commit 2 file lớn
# (transactions.jsonl, transaction_events.jsonl — sinh lại bằng `make data`,
# byte-identical theo seed 20260802).
data/*
!data/raw/
!data/schema/
!data/generated/
data/generated/*
!data/generated/manifest.json
!data/generated/users.jsonl
!data/generated/wallets.jsonl
!data/generated/bank_accounts.jsonl
!data/generated/complaints.jsonl
!data/generated/tickets.jsonl
!data/generated/auth_sessions.jsonl
